# One solvent budget, several extractions
#
# A separatory funnel does not reward one large shake as much as several
# smaller shakes with fresh solvent. This run gives four equal portions the
# same TOTAL hexane allowance as the one-stage comparison printed beside it.
# The engine computes both from phase volumes and K = [I2]hexane/[I2]water;
# neither percentage is scripted into the lesson.
register lv2

add v1 water 2mol
add v1 I2 0.001mol
extract v1 v2 hexane 0.5mol stages 4

# At lv3 the result also names the coefficient direction, mass balance,
# saturation guard and provenance. This reviewed iodine model is restricted
# to 25 °C; other solutes with molecular group decompositions use the shared
# UNIFAC route, while unsupported pairs are refused explicitly.
register lv3
inspect v1
inspect v2
